  type: 1
  description: 
  sentences:
    nameNPC: "T\xF4i"
    Lines:
    - "M\u1EB7t tr\u1EDDi cu\u1ED1i h\u1EA1 r\u1EA3i v\xE0ng tr\xEAn b\xE3i c\xE1t
      ven s\xF4ng Ho\xE0ng Long. Ti\u1EBFng tr\u1EBB con r\xEDu r\xEDt vang v\u1ECDng
      gi\u1EEFa \u0111\u1ED3ng xanh. L\u0169 tr\u1EBB trong l\xE0ng ch\u1EB7t nh\u1EEFng
      c\xE0nh lau, c\u1EAFm xu\u1ED1ng c\xE1t l\xE0m c\u1EDD, chia phe t\u1EADp tr\u1EADn.
      \u1EDE gi\u1EEFa \u0111\xE1m \u0111\xF4ng, m\u1ED9t c\u1EADu b\xE9 v\u1EDBi
      \xE1nh m\u1EAFt s\xE1ng qu\u1EAFc, tay c\u1EA7m c\xE0nh lau gi\u01A1 cao \u2013
      \u0111\xF3 ch\xEDnh l\xE0 \u0110inh Ho\xE0n (t\xEAn thu\u1EDF nh\u1ECF c\u1EE7a
      \u0110inh B\u1ED9 L\u0129nh)."
    - "M\xE1u hi\u1EBFu th\u1EAFng c\u1EE7a tu\u1ED5i th\u01A1 h\xF2a c\xF9ng b\u1EA7u
      kh\xF4ng kh\xED h\u1ED3n nhi\xEAn, nh\u01B0ng trong \xE1nh m\u1EAFt \u1EA5y
      \u0111\xE3 th\u1EA5p tho\xE1ng kh\xED ch\u1EA5t c\u1EE7a b\u1EADc \u0111\u1EBF
      v\u01B0\u01A1ng."
